Route Protection

Every protected route must verify the user's subscription before rendering.

Example:

User Requests Route
        │
        ▼
Authenticate User
        │
        ▼
Validate Subscription
        │
        ▼
Check Module Permissions
        │
 ┌──────┴──────┐
 │             │
Allow      Redirect to Pricing

Both client-side navigation and server-side requests must enforce this logic.

Backend Authorization

Every protected API endpoint must validate:

Authenticated user
Subscription status
Subscription tier
Module permission

Never rely solely on the frontend for authorization.

